  DavySayings:
  - Yarr, Davy Jones be appearing in front of ye.  Pick a card, if ye dare...
  - 'Fortune favours the bold, captain.  '
  - Avast ye Captain!  Pick a card or face Davy Jones' wrath!
  - A sea hag gave me these cards. Swore they were safe, too.
  - Pick ye card.  Ye belong to the sea all the same.
  - "One card for ye, two for me. Fair\u2019s fair."
  - Pick carefully. The sea always remembers.
  - Fortune's waiting Captain.  Best not keep her.
